current byte verification.\ncc/engine_handoff/envelopes.py:397:            \"test_assessment\": assessment, \"claim_category\": claim_category,\ncc/engine_handoff/envelopes.py:420:    result.add_argument(\"--claim-category\", default=\"unclassified\")\ncc/engine_handoff/envelopes.py:431:            value = make_result(args.job_dir, args.attempt, args.claim_category, manifest_path=args.manifest)\ncc/moe_planner/PLANNER.md:215:footprint and stable candidate ID. No cross-tier speed claim is implied.\ncc/moe_planner/plan.py:383:            # Existing reference logits are 20x512. Do not claim this tests ctx=4096.\n","exit_code":2,"status":"failed"}}
