ause staging differs. Never count an OOM or changed context length as a valid matched run.\ncc/moe_static_hot/README.md:121:Success means a reproducible token/logit correctness result and lower decode latency at matched measured GPU bytes than both controls. Failure is useful evidence: D2D staging plus miss H2D may outweigh static-residency gains. A true CPU-miss/GPU-hit engine would require additional graph/kernel dispatch work beyond this minimal existing-path patch; no harness-derived throughput estimate is claimed here.\ncc/engine_handoff/README.md:58:all original claims remain declared. Image config ID, platform, layer count, and\ncc/engine_handoff/README.md:94:and compares its identity claims. A record's incomplete executable map remains\ncc/engine_handoff/README.md:128:left identities null because it treated all build-record identities as claims.\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Read-only, dependency-free resource observation. See CONTRACT.md.\"\"\"\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport argparse\nimport csv\nimport datetime as dt\nfrom decimal import Decimal\nimport io\nimport json\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport re\nimport socket\nimport subprocess\nimport sys\nimport time\nfrom collections.abc import Iterator, Mapping\n\nGPU_QUERY = 'uuid,memory.used,memory.total,utilization.gpu,temperature.gpu,power.draw,clocks.sm,clocks.mem'\nAPP_QUERY = 'gpu_uuid,pid,used_memory'\nGPU_SPECS = {\n    'gpu.memory.used': ('memory.used', 'MiB'),\n    'gpu.memory.total': ('memory.total', 'MiB'),\n    'gpu.util': ('utilization.gpu', '%'),\n    'gpu.temp': ('temperature.gpu', 'degC'),\n    'gpu.power': ('power.draw', 'W'),\n    'gpu.clocks.sm': ('clocks.current.sm', 'MHz'),\n    'gpu.clocks.memory': ('clocks.current.memory', 'MHz'),\n}\nHOST_SPECS = {\n    'host.mem.total': 'MemTotal', 'host.mem.available': 'MemAvailable',\n    'host.mem.swap.total': 'SwapTotal', 'host.mem.swap.free': 'SwapFree',\n}\nCGROUP_SPECS = {\n    'cgroup.memory.current': 'memory.cu